# Custom Dropdowns Only

Never use native `<select>` / `<option>` in UI forms or filters.

- Always use the shared custom dropdown (`app-select` or equivalent in the stack).
- Native browser select styling looks outdated and breaks brand consistency.
- Dropdowns must support RTL, brand colors, hover/active states, and click-outside close.
- Options should be passed as `{ label, value }[]`.
- Wire to Reactive Forms via `ControlValueAccessor` / `formControlName`.

If a page still has `<select>`, replace it before finishing the task.
